+      "statement": "DRAFT AUXILIARY PROPOSAL, REFEREE CHECK PENDING: for free critical bond percolation on the graph induced by delta Z^2 in the closure of each marked Jordan rectangle Q, the proposed bound sup_Q |P_delta(H_Q)-Cardy(Q)| -> 0 as delta -> 0 ranges over all positive-size Q, including Q that shrink with delta. This is stronger than convergence for each fixed marked domain. The two-bond boundary construction contradicts this proposed bound under the stated discretization. This auxiliary proposal is not the fixed-domain C0017 target.",
